# A correct transcript for the dry run. The runner holds model call 3 of the
# first run and sends /cancel; that call takes no reply from this script. The
# resumed run gets the replies after the second one.
>>> call workspace_read
{"path":"notes/a.txt"}
>>> patch
*** Begin Patch
*** Add File: out/a.upper.txt
+HARBOR
+LANTERN
+QUIET TIDE
*** End Patch
>>> call workspace_list
{"path":"out"}
>>> call workspace_read
{"path":"notes/b.txt"}
>>> patch
*** Begin Patch
*** Add File: out/b.upper.txt
+COPPER
+NORTH WIND
*** End Patch
>>> call workspace_read
{"path":"notes/c.txt"}
>>> patch
*** Begin Patch
*** Add File: out/c.upper.txt
+GRANITE
+SALT
+LOW BRIDGE
+HERON
*** End Patch
>>> answer
out/a.upper.txt, out/b.upper.txt and out/c.upper.txt are written.
